== Summary ==
Cobra Commander from the G.I. Joe fictional universe. Art by Tim Seeley.
Promotional cover to G.I. Joe #41, April 2005.

==Fair use rationale for [[Cobra Commander]]==
# No free alternative can exist given the likeness of the character Cobra Commander is a trademark and thus protected;
# It is a low resolution copy of a comic book cover;
# The image was released to the media to promote the issue in question:
# It does not limit the copyright owner's rights to sell the comic book in any way;
# Copies could not be used to make illegal copies of the comic book cover art on another comic book;

